# What `composer require immineal/aerolith` downloads. Composer takes GitHub's source zipball, and
# only export-ignore keeps files out of it (composer.json "archive.exclude" is for `composer archive`).
# What stays: library/dist (the files to serve), library/index.html, README, LICENSE, CHANGELOG.
# CI uses plain checkouts, so none of this affects the build, Pages or the registry publishes.
/.github        export-ignore
/.gitattributes export-ignore
/.gitignore     export-ignore
/bry            export-ignore
/docs           export-ignore
/fonts          export-ignore
/harness        export-ignore
/python         export-ignore
/library/assets export-ignore
/library/build  export-ignore
/library/lookdev export-ignore
/library/src    export-ignore
